# WHATDO — VIRAL IDENTITY, LOCATION-BASED VOTING & AI SHARE CARD

You are modifying the existing WhatDo application. Do NOT rebuild the application from scratch. First inspect the existing codebase, architecture, database schema, authentication, voting/post system, location handling, UI components, and existing APIs.

The objective is to add a viral social-media growth loop around WhatDo.

The core user journey should become:

**Discover → Register → Answer/Vote → Compare → Get WhatDo Identity → Generate Share Card → Share on Instagram/WhatsApp → Friend clicks → Friend tries WhatDo**

