# 23. QUESTION SELECTION ALGORITHM

Do not show completely random questions.

Build a scoring/selection system.

Question score can consider:

30% engagement potential
20% relevance
15% freshness
15% diversity
10% locality
10% historical performance

Also avoid:

* Duplicate questions
* Too many questions from the same category
* Repeated questions recently answered by the same user

For a 12-question WhatDo assessment, for example:

2 Personality
2 Lifestyle
1 Money
1 Career
1 Technology
1 Relationship
1 Entertainment
1 Food/Travel
1 Current trend
1 Local

The mix should be configurable.

